# --- Phase 0 repo hygiene (PRD v4.1 §15 / §26): generated artifacts ---
# 87 generated artifacts were previously committed (outputs/ 70,
# logs/ 10, root-level junk 7). They are regenerable: completeness-sweep
# cell caches, UI QA screenshots/DOM dumps, diagnostic run JSON, the
# experiment ledger, and scratch/diagnostic text files. Nothing in the
# test suite READS any of these as a fixture -- every reference is a
# write (tests/qa_*.py) or a historical docstring pointer. Keep them on
# disk locally; they simply must not be treated as source.
#
# Two corrections to the first pass of this change:
#  * The patterns are ANCHORED to the repo root (leading /) and match
#    directory CONTENTS (/*) rather than the directory. An unanchored
#    `logs/` also matched `astraeus/logs/` (which holds a tracked
#    project document), and git cannot re-include a file whose parent
#    directory is excluded -- so `dir/*` + `!dir/file` is the form that
#    actually preserves the two hand-written files below.
#  * `runs/kepler90_blind_search.py` and `logs/research_log.md` are NOT
#    generated artifacts. The former is a 548-line source driver cited
#    by docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-30-data-ingestion-solid-refactor-design.md;
#    the latter is created by scratch/init_project.py and listed in
#    PROJECT_BRIEFING_v0.0.2.md. Both stay tracked.
/outputs/*
/logs/*
!/logs/research_log.md
/runs/*
!/runs/kepler90_blind_search.py
# P05-A benchmark curve cache: downloaded + stitched real light curves.
# Regenerable via `py benchmarks/tls_multiprocessing_benchmark.py acquire`;
# the measured RESULTS under benchmarks/results/ are the tracked artifact,
# not the input data they were taken on.
/benchmarks/cache/*
# Root-level regenerable diagnostic junk.
/out.txt
/out2.txt
/qa_results.json
/scratch_session_state.txt
/pytest_out.txt

# --- P2-B: Next.js slice artifacts (regenerable) ---
/web/.next/
/web/out/
*.tsbuildinfo
# --- Dev-server runtime (regenerable; tests use tmp_path) ---
/artifacts/
*.db*
# --- Bucket 7: untracked regenerable artifacts (root-only) ---# Sibling of the already-ignored test.html (Plotly debug export).
test3d.html
# Root-level duplicate of logs/experiments.json. Anchored to the repo
# root so it does NOT affect logs/experiments.json.
/experiments.json
# Regen pytest / diagnostic output that should never have been committed.
pytest_log.txt
pytest_output.txt
test_orchestrator_log.txt